   },
   "text": "The gangs that work the lower channel are hired out of Alten Corimont, but the tree the gang families answer to stands nine bends upriver, where the water is still fresh enough to drink. The village grew where the tree is. The work has been a day downriver for sixty years.",
   "confirmed": {
    "sha": "f1d38df37c2e",
    "note": "The Hist that the village grew round, on the river bank with its landing for the boats downriver.",
    "ids": [
     "place.pirate-freeholds.upriver-hist-village.landmark.upriver-hist-village.the-hist",
     "dock1"
    ]
   }
  },
